proton-autogen (3.1.8) noble; urgency=medium

  * Thanks to all users and contributors for their continued support, feedback and encouragement throughout the development of proton-autogen.
  * Added optional Gamescope support for improved fullscreen compatibility and a more consistent gaming experience.
  * Added the --gamescope command-line option to force launching games through Gamescope.
  * Added Proton-specific environment variables to improve compatibility with supported Proton versions.
  * Improved the DX9/OpenGL profile for better compatibility and stability with legacy OpenGL games.
  * Improved runtime detection and Gamescope integration.
  * Minor stability improvements and internal code cleanup.
  * General stability improvements and code cleanup.

